    "text": "<p>Data given for the following reaction is as follows :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeO</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>graphite</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Substance</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>Jmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeO</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>266</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>57</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>49</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>graphite</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>74</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>28</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>110</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>197</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>The minimum temperature in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> at which the reaction becomes spontaneous is_____.(Integer answer)</p>",
